  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "He first appears when Gui Wang delivers three and a half million lava bats to a mini-sun door. A youthful, round-faced rank six Gu Immortal in a snow fox fur robe steps out on a jade bridge, takes the bats into Hong Yu blessed land, and agrees to barge into Lang Ya blessed land a month later with Gui Wang. He worries that the land spirit still holds the place for only two attackers, then is shocked when Gui Wang says the righteous path Hua Hai three immortals will join.",
      "chapters": [
        446
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_gui_wang",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_hong_yu_blessed_land",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "fac_hua_hai_three_immortals"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gui Wang later names that same gathering as the force he can raise for Lang Ya, while saying he lacks chips to pull them against Zi Du blessed land as well.",
      "chapters": [
        448
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_lang_ya_sect",
        "loc_zi_du_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has a youthful appearance and a round and white face. He wears a snow fox fur robe. He has brown eyes that heat up and turn a color resembling heated metal, and his gaze becomes hot.",
      "chapters": [
        446
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He has the appearance of a youth, with a round face and fair appearance.",
      "chapters": [
        459
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At crescent lake he asks whether Lang Ya blessed land is hidden there while Gui Wang waits for the earthly calamity. He again stands as a rank six Gu Immortal with youthful look, round face, and fair appearance beside Gui Wang.",
      "chapters": [
        459
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "attack-on-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He waits with Gui Wang apart from the Hua Hai three immortals. Those righteous path sisters hold him in contempt for killing his own parents to refine a Gu and for betraying his brothers, yet still collaborate for Immortal Gu recipes. He watches Endless Thunder and Lightning Rain open holes, supports pressing the assault, and later turns into a red light to race Gui Wang into the blessed land, then approaches a cloud building among the twelve.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "attack-on-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_recipe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside, he stands with Gui Wang among captives when Lang Ya land spirit bargains with Fang Yuan, and both look at Fairy Huang Sha with burning gazes when the land spirit offers her as a plaything; Fang Yuan refuses that use.",
      "chapters": [
        464
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "attack-on-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_fairy_huang_sha"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He and Gui Wang are disappointed when Fang Yuan declines.",
      "chapters": [
        465
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "attack-on-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later sees him among familiar faces in Lang Ya’s coffins with the Hua Hai three immortals and Gui Wang.",
      "chapters": [
        744
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "captive-sale",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At the open transaction Qin Bai Sheng presents him as a rank six fire path Gu Immortal captive at one heavenly tribulation, shows his immortal aperture, and notes fire path demand for that aperture. He eventually goes into Five Elements Grandmaster’s hands because that buyer cultivates all five paths and can use the aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        762
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "captive-sale",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "char_five_elements_grandmaster"
      ]
    }
  ],
